Handle at least:
- User cancels OAuth.
- State mismatch or callback replay.
- Redirect URI mismatch.
- Client configuration missing.
- API disabled.
- Picker script blocked.
- API key referrer restriction mismatch.
- User denies scopes.
- Refresh token absent or invalid.
- Access token expires.
- Consent revoked.
- File deleted or trashed.
- File moved or renamed.
- File permission removed.
- Folder children not listable.
- canDownload false.
