Troubleshooting quick map
Symptom	Likely check
redirect_uri_mismatch	OAuth callback URI must match exactly in Google Cloud and app config.
origin_mismatch	Add the exact scheme/host/port used by the browser.
Picker says developer key invalid	Check API restrictions and add both LORIN's website referrer and https://docs.google.com/*.
Picker opens but file import fails	Check actual granted scope, selected-file authorization, Drive API enablement and capabilities.canDownload.
Refresh token missing	Verify server-side offline access, token exchange and consent flow; do not move token handling to browser storage.
Some folder items missing	Check capabilities.canListChildren, per-file access and selected-file grants; do not assume recursive permission.
Google Docs has no downloadable binary content	Use the Drive export operation and a supported export MIME type.
Sync says connected but never updates	Check stored start page token, changes.list cursor, job queue, webhook expiry and reconciliation worker.
Production says unverified app	Review scope sensitivity/restriction, consent branding, owned domains, privacy policy and Google verification requirements.